WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:35.600
Micchi, Welcome

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:06.330
I… for what purpose am I here?

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:22.050
Are you awake?

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:24.840
What day is it?

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:27.100
What time is it?

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.990
You were resting for two days.

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:32.170
This medicine stinks.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:34.090
I'm going to take a shower.

00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:35.610
Get my clothes.

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:37.150
Eh? You should rest-

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:38.240
Kazusa.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:41.810
I'm fine…

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:51.540
W-What is this?

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:53.920
It's eel-

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:57.660
Never mind, I don't want to know!

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:02.490
It's about time Kazune-kun woke up,
 so I made this for him.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:05.750
If he ate this, he would probably pass out again.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:06.930
What's that?

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:10.770
I did my best to make it for him.

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:13.230
I… I…

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:16.880
It's my fault…

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:21.110
Because I lost my ring, Kazune-kun transformed.

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:25.370
Karin-chan, it's not good to blame yourself!

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:27.440
If I had been more responsible…

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:29.380
Sup'.

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:36.300
Kazune-kun, you woke up.

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:36.960
Are you okay?

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:38.920
Yeah.

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:41.680
Man, I'm hungry… Let's eat.

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:43.590
Yeah, just wait a second!

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:45.200
I'll go get something to eat.

00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:47.960
Karin?

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:51.330
Where's Himeka?

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:02.350
Himeka!

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:07.740
Kazune-chan.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:10.160
What's wrong? A fever?

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:12.830
I'm fine…

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:15.460
Sorry.

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:18.090
Since when?

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:21.470
Ever since we got home from the school play.

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:23.590
I'm fine…

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:27.260
I'm just a little dizzy.

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:29.850
Kazune-sama.

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:50.160
I wonder what's wrong.

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:53.790
You should take a good long rest.

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:03.880
Kazune-kun?

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:05.760
Is it my fault?

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:08.970
That Himeka collapsed…

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:14.270
The balance of the rings power is probably changing.

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:19.980
She came… didn't she?

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:22.030
The Karasuma's Himeka.

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:22.860
Yeah…

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:29.120
If their Himeka becomes healthy…

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:31.330
this Himeka becomes ill.

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:34.830
In other words, my ring's power has become weaker…

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:36.460
because of that Himeka…

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:38.170
No way.

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:39.960
Kazune-kun, you're always-

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:46.050
What's wrong?

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:48.140
Nothing.

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:50.640
More importantly, is it alright for you to be up?

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:57.980
I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:05.640
Kazune-kun is always thinking in Himeka-chan's best interest.

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:11.160
What should I do?

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:14.050
Kazune-kun collapses after he transforms.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:17.870
If the balance tips completely, Himeka-chan will…

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:19.100
disappear.

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:25.130
I have to protect them.

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:33.680
There's no one left but him.

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:38.770
Karin.

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:39.810
What?

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:44.110
I was thinking about what I said the other day.

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:45.110
Yeah.

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:49.990
If my power weakens, then we have no other choice.

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:52.700
Allies…

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:09.130
How do we go about this?

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:12.510
I thought about that.

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:14.760
A plan to get him on our side.

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:17.140
A plan to get him on our side?

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:19.100
D-Do you mean…?!

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:22.560
Please, join me. Uh-hu!

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:24.270
Something like this?

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:27.610
Will you join me and play? Uh-hu!

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:29.030
Or something like this?

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:31.030
Or maybe… this?!

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:34.070
I'm not going to be a Belly Dancer.

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:36.330
What are you saying all of a sudden?

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:41.210
Forgive me for having to use seductive measures…

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:42.920
I'm the one doing it.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:45.380
Y-You are?!

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:47.960
T-That's possible too.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:48.800
Kazune-kun!

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:49.970
Huh?

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:52.430
Here, I brought all the stuff for you.

00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:53.510
You moron!

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:55.010
What I was thinking of…

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:59.180
was just making myself look like my dad again and asking him!

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:01.270
In that manner?

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:02.480
Kazune-kun.

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:07.070
Damn it!

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:10.070
There's no time for Kazune-kun to change his appearance!

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:11.320
I need to talk with you.

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:13.070
M-Micchi!

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:16.280
I am God!

00:08:16.280 --> 00:08:17.780
Then, let's go.

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.290
Okay.

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:21.560
How long are going to dance there?

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:24.980
Hanazono-san, it suits you.

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:27.290
What was that?

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:30.550
Somehow I feel like that's more of an insult.

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:40.760
What is it?

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:46.230
What can I do?

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:51.190
I can't transform,…

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:54.990
even if I have the ring.

00:08:54.990 --> 00:08:56.210
Can I?

00:08:57.240 --> 00:09:03.950
Honestly, I saw the power you and Hanazono-san had to use to beat Karasuma.

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:13.550
I don't have the power to transform as I am.

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:20.760
But… without a doubt, this ring reacts to other rings.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:26.810
To tell you the truth…

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:29.860
it reacted once before.

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:31.960
That was when…

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:40.580
professor Kujyou had just passed away.

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:47.920
In order to find out more about professor Kujyou…

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:49.920
I researched information about the rings.

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:54.440
"Why can't I transform?" I wondered.

00:09:56.930 --> 00:10:00.180
"If I don't have any power at all…

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:04.430
then why did professor Kujyou give me this ring?" I wondered.

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:07.350
I don't know why exactly either.

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:08.720
But…

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:12.440
I might have some kind of power, right?

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:13.340
Yeah.

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:23.790
Geez! Kazune-kun just left me behind to go talk to Micchi.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:28.290
I wonder if it went well.

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:30.790
Welcome home, Hanazono-san!

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:32.380
Here.

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:34.050
Micchi!

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:35.460
What's going on?

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:38.340
I'm here to live with you guys!

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:40.090
Huh?

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:41.780
He has become our ally.

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:43.100
Huh?!

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:45.430
Living together?

00:10:49.730 --> 00:10:50.720
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:54.260
I am God!

00:10:57.970 --> 00:10:59.220
You moron.

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.220
It's a croquette!

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:03.090
It seems that Nishikiyori has joined the likes of Kujyou.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:11.920
Kujyou, because the balance has tipped, you're going to rely on Nishikiyori's power.

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:14.670
That destructive power.

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:19.680
If that's so, we will have to prepare ourselves also.

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:22.430
Nii-san, what are you want?

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:27.180
Nii-san, that's enough already!

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:28.600
Any more and…

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:36.530
Micchi has come too!

00:11:36.530 --> 00:11:39.240
This will be fun.

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:44.320
Kazune-chan?

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:46.740
Ah, sorry. I was thinking about something.

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:51.210
Geez! Kazune-kun, you! Just what were you thinking?

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:54.170
Sorry, Himeka.

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:57.880
I'll definitely find a way to make you get better.

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:00.550
Kazune-chan.

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:06.180
I'm sorry for making you worry…

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:13.480
- Hanazono-san!

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:13.480
- Micchi?!

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:15.520
I missed you!

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:19.190
I went to the bathroom and got lost.

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:21.280
Ah, you too?

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:25.660
When I first came here, I got lost in this labyrinth all the time too.

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:28.080
This house it just too big.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:29.540
All right!

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:31.580
I'll give you a tour of the house.

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:35.800
Yes! Hanazono-san is the nicest after all!

00:12:35.800 --> 00:12:38.170
Especially that cute smile, it's the best.

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:40.300
What are you saying?

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:42.800
Even if it's just flattery…

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:46.680
the only boy who says nice things to me is Micchi.

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:51.890
Unlike Kazune-kun, who is always mean and cold…

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:55.560
and has a head full of thoughts of Himeka-chan.

00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:58.190
And whenever he acts nice…

00:12:58.190 --> 00:12:59.980
I have no idea what he's thinking.

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:02.860
What's wrong? You seem down!

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:04.280
What are you thinking about?

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:06.740
N-No, that's…

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:08.490
When we're together…

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:11.040
you should only think about the two of us.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:17.000
Micchi's eyes are so pretty.

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:22.880
I feel like all my worries are fading away.

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:28.970
Hey, Hanazono-san.

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:32.020
How did you get your god transformation ring?

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:34.560
I got it from my mother.

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:35.940
Hmm...

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:39.610
So then, how were you able to transform?

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:41.440
That's because, um…

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:42.230
Kazune-kun-

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:44.150
Nishikiyori.

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:46.320
I'll take you to your room.

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:50.240
I prefer Hanazono-san's room!

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:53.580
J-Just what are you saying!

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:56.540
W-We're too young! And something like that is perverted!

00:13:56.540 --> 00:14:00.290
It's fine, isn't it? Being alone is lonely!

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:01.790
Ah! Or maybe…

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:04.510
All three of us should share a room!

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:07.880
Well… I was going to give you my dad's old room.

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:11.220
Professor Kujyou's?

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:40.170
Micchi?

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:44.050
I wonder why?

00:14:44.050 --> 00:14:46.050
I just can't open the door.

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:49.730
I should be happy, but…

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:52.740
my hand just won't move.

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:57.730
Why… did you decide to put me in this room?

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:02.770
Because, it seems like my dad was important to you.

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:09.350
I should tell you something, because we are allies, right?

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:16.180
About professor Kujyou and me.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:24.880
My father was his underclassman at university.

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:27.670
He was a professor's assistant in England.

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:33.010
Ever since I was little, I knew of him.

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:35.060
But…

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:41.060
When I was six, there was a car accident.

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:57.040
My parents died instantly,…

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:59.450
and I was also severely injured.

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:05.790
The one who saved my life… was professor Kujyou.

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:12.930
You must never give up.

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:19.310
I went back to Japan, after I got out of the hospital.

00:16:20.850 --> 00:16:24.860
Because I had lost my parents…

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:27.040
I was all alone.

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:31.360
You're not alone.

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:39.040
Professor Kujyou looked after me.

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:46.290
To me he was like a second father.

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:52.300
He gave me a life.

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:58.010
No, not just my life…

00:16:58.010 --> 00:17:00.310
he saved my heart as well.

00:17:01.060 --> 00:17:02.770
He was my family.

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:06.860
He's the same as me.

00:17:06.860 --> 00:17:10.230
No, the same as Kazune-kun and Himeka-chan as well.

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:12.740
Micchi, also…

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:15.650
lost his family and was all alone.

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:21.600
That happened after he left here.

00:18:11.050 --> 00:18:16.050
Professor. I want to know why you gave this to me,…

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:18.340
why I lived up until now.

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:23.470
And… why I met Hanazono-san and Kazune-kun.

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:28.900
Was all this by your wishing?

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:36.240
Being alone…

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:37.900
is awful.

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:47.330
Himeka-san, is it alright for you to be up?

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:48.870
You look exhausted.

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:54.420
I'm fine. Thank you.

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:57.130
Hey!

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:59.010
By the way, what the heck is this?

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:02.600
Ah, you know…

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:06.180
Because Micchi came, I made it as a welcome present.

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:08.190
It's Eel Gratin.

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:09.900
Welcome present?

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:12.060
This doesn't look welcoming in the least.

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:13.480
How rude!

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:15.380
I'm happy.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:16.760
Thank you.

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:21.660
Micchi!

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:26.800
Delicious!

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:29.620
Micchi!!!

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:32.880
How are you still alive?

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:35.090
Watch how you speak!

00:19:35.090 --> 00:19:37.260
Micchi is different, unlike a certain someone.

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:41.680
He can tell the difference between bad and good food.

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:44.600
Even I know good food!

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:49.100
Can you see now, Kazune-kun?

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:55.110
Hey, Kazune-kun. I wonder if I can transform too.

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:56.820
What's wrong, all of a sudden?

00:19:56.820 --> 00:19:58.740
Because if I can transform too…

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:01.570
I could protect Himeka-san as well.

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:03.490
Oh, you're right!

00:20:03.490 --> 00:20:05.120
Well said, Micchi!

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:07.240
I'm happy!

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:11.790
Micchi, thank you.

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:13.540
So, Kazune-kun…

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:15.500
Do you think I can transform too?

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:17.130
Probably…

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:20.670
I-I'm going to the bathroom.

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:23.050
All right, I'll do my best!

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:26.100
I'm cheering you on, Micchi!

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:28.390
Let's both work hard!

00:20:34.480 --> 00:20:37.320
It's still small…

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:40.400
but what a frightening power...

00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:43.410
The power that's leaking out of Nishikiyori…

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:46.240
If Nishikiyori's power…

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:48.790
is as powerful as Karasuma said-

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:52.290
What?

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:53.920
It can't be… that-

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:59.460
Oh, Micchi!

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:02.220
If you eat that much I'll be too happy!

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:03.680
Want some more?

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:04.930
Of course!

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:06.890
Then, I'll go get some more!

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:10.640
Mi-Micchi, are you alright eating that much?

00:21:10.640 --> 00:21:12.440
Don't worry.

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:17.000
I once drank 742 sheets of milkshake in one go!

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:17.000
Micchi used the wrong word to count milkshakes. Instead of glasses he said sheets.

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:26.570
Micchi!

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:31.040
Mi-Micchi… you pushed yourself too far.

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:32.870
He managed to survive…

00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:35.370
after eating that much of Karin-sama's cooking.

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:41.880
A bug?

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:43.420
Well, whatever.

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:45.550
Kazune-kun.

00:21:45.550 --> 00:21:47.760
Micchi asked for seconds, you know!

00:21:47.760 --> 00:21:49.890
Huh? Micchi?

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:52.020
Yep! Micchi did!

00:21:52.020 --> 00:21:56.630
Micchi, Micchi, Micchi… Micchi! Idiot!

00:21:57.060 --> 00:21:59.320
Boring!

00:21:59.820 --> 00:22:01.940
What's wrong, Kazune-kun?

00:22:01.940 --> 00:22:04.370
You, do you hate me?

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:07.140
W-What are you saying all of a sudden?

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:09.240
I-It's hot…

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:12.370
What is this pattern?

00:22:12.370 --> 00:22:15.290
Is he suddenly going to hug me again?

00:22:15.290 --> 00:22:17.300
Then we should kiss…

00:22:17.300 --> 00:22:19.130
What are you saying?

00:22:19.460 --> 00:22:21.130
I know,…

00:22:21.130 --> 00:22:23.260
that you kissed Nishikiyori.

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Saa, ikou yo shiranai michi

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Come, let's go down an unknown path.

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
Sugu kieru mayotetteta

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
It will soon dissappear, and we'll be lost.

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Hamikaze  sasotte

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Invited by the humming wind…

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
Sasayaku kuchi no hou ikutte uta

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
…that whispered out of my singing mouth.

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
Sagashiteta mirai soba ni aru

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
The future you're looking for is right next to you.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
Messeeji wa hitotsu kasanaru yo

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
The messages are all piling up, one by one.

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
Sora e kabatte tobashite yume o kabatte sakebu yo

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
I'm going to fly up, protected into the sky and shout my dreams out to the world.

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
Kimi ni todoke nanairo no michi tokuchuu meeru

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
So that it'll reach you, my special delivery mail along a rainbow-coloured road.

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
Hakanai negai demo isshunkai hanatto yo

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
I won't abandon my fleeting wish, even for a second.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
Kimi ni todoke kono omoi to kimi ni fuiteta kaze wo

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
So that my feelings will reach you, through this blowing wind.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:10.170
Himeka-chan and the Fortunetelling Glasses Guy
